# Intentionally contains no Kubernetes Secret object or credential material.
#
# SAGE zero-trust deployment now loads the tunnel credential from an
# Ansible Vault-encrypted controller-local secrets file outside Git and sends
# the Kubernetes Secret definition directly to `kubectl apply -f -` over
# protected process stdin. This compatibility stub prevents the prior
# plaintext-on-disk render pattern from being silently reintroduced.
